    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosia ogosiria ogosasimwa kw’emegwekano",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Amg 34:3-7,29-33)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti agatoma abanto barangerie abagaaka bonsi b’Abayuda na aba Yerusalemu, bagasangererekana asare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na omorwoti agatiira gochia ase enyomba y’Omonene amo n’Abayuda bonsi na abanto bonsi bamenyete Yerusalemu, na abakuani, na ababani, abanto bonsi, abake na abanene. Erio akabasomera amang’ana onsi aria ariikire ase Egetabu keria gi’Okobwatana kw’Ogotianania yanyorekanete ime ase enyomba y’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti agatenena ang’e nesiiro, agakora okobwatana kw’ogotianania ase obosio bw’Omonene, ng’a mbabwatie Omonene na kobwata amachiiko aye, na oborori bwaye, na emeroberio yaye echiikire, bayakore ne chinkoro chiabo chionsi na emioyo yabo yonsi, mbakore amang’ana onsi aganeirie nokobwatana oko kw’ogotianania, ayarikire ase egetabu eke. Erio abanto bonsi bakaria eira ng’a mbabwate okobwatana koria kw’ogotianania.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omorwoti agachiika Hilikia, Omokuani bw’omonene, na abakuani, abakoonyi baye, na abarendi b’egesieri, barusie korwa ase Hekalu y’Omonene ebikorero bionsi biaroisetwe ase ogosasimera Baali na Asera, na erioba, na omotienyi, ne ching’enang’eni chionsi chia igoro. Magega y’ayio akabisambera isiko ya Yerusalemu, agwo ase egetii gia Kidironi, akaira ribu riabo Beteli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende akarusia abakuani baarenge gosasiima emegwekano, baria abarwoti b’Abayuda babeegete gosambera ubani agwo aase aimokererete igoro ase emechie y’Abayuda na goetanana Yerusalemu; naboigo nabaria baarenge gosamba ubani ase Baali, na erioba, na omotienyi, ne ching’enang’eni chionsi chia igoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo akarenta omote oria bw’Asera korwa ase enyomba y’Omonene, akayosokia isiko ya Yerusalemu, akayoira gochia ase Rikura ria Kidironi, akayosamunyorera aroro, akayosia okaba orotu; erio akaruta orotu orwo igoro ase chimbeera agwo ase abanto baare gotindekwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agatagora na koiyeria inse chinyomba chi’abasaacha abanyaka baare korigania ase obosooku, echio chiarenge ase enyomba y’Omonene. (Ime ase chinyomba chiria abakungu baarenge koroiseria Asera, enyasae eria enkuungu, chiema.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akarenta abakuani bonsi korwa ase emechie y’Abayuda, na ase ense yonsi korwa Geba goika Beeri‐Seba agakora aase onsi aimokererete igoro agwo ase abakuani baarenge gosambera ubani akaba aatachenegeti. Na ebisasimero bi’aase aimokererete igoro arenge agwo ase ebiita bi’omochie, keria kiarenge ase egesoero ki’Egeita kia Yoshua, omogabana bw’omochie, na keria kiarenge ensemo y’okobee y’oyo ogosoera omochie, omorwoti akabitagora akabiyeria inse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende nonya abakuani b’aase aimokererete igoro agosasimerwa tibaarenge ne ribaga gocha ase egesasiimero ki’Omonene agwo Yerusalemu, bakaba bakoria emegati etabekiri memera amo nabamwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo omorwoti agasaria Tofeti, aase agosasimerwa agwo ase Rikura ria mosinto o Hinomu, agaakora aatachenegeti ng’a onde tasambera omwana oye, omomura gose omoiseke, aroro abe ekeng’wanso ase enyasae eria Moleki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende akarusia chibarasi chiria abarwoti b’Abayuda babeegete ase egesoero ki’enyomba y’Omonene, echio baruete ase ogosasiima erioba. Nigo chiarenge ang’e nakanyomba ka Nathani‐Meleki, omoteneneri bw’enyomba y’omorwoti, ime ase enyomba gete ensemo ya bosongo; agasamba chigari chiria chiatananetwe ase erioba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agatagora na akaiyeria inse ebisasimero biarenge igoro ase ekerama ang’e nakanyomba ka igoro k’Ahasi, biria abarwoti b’Abayuda baagachete, na biria Manase aagachete ase chiraaro ibere chi’enyomba y’Omonene. Akabinachana ebing’ese, erio akaruta orotu rwabo ase akarooche ga Kidironi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na aase aimokerete igoro agosasimerwa arenge moocha ya Yerusalemu, Irianyi y’egetunwa ki’Obosareku, aria Sulemani, omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli, aagacherete Asitaroti, okogechia kw’Abasidoni, na Kemosi, okogechia kw’Abamoabu, na Milikomu, okogechia kw’Abaamoni, omorwoti agaakora akaba aatachenegeti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akanachana chisiiro chi’ogosasimerwa chikaba ebing’ese, na akanacha emete y’Asera, enyasae yabo enkuungu, agaichoria aase abo namauga ’abaanto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo agatagora egesasiimero kiarenge agwo Beteli igoro y’aase aria aimokererete igoro agosasimerwa aria aroisetigwe na Yeroboamu, mosinto o Nebati, oria ogerete Abaisraeli bagakora ebibe. Agasaria aase aria aimokererete igoro na agatagora egesasiimero keria akagesenyenta gekaba orotu; agasamba omote bw’Asera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Yosia aonchogete, akarora chimbeera chiarenge ase ekegoro igoro, agatoma abanto bakarenta amauga korwa ase chimbeera chiria ime, erio akayasambera ase egesasiimero, na ekio gekaba egetachenegeti, koreng’ana ne ring’ana ri’Omonene riaraaretigwe nomonto o Nyasae, oria obaanete igoro ase ebinto ebio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio akabora: “Nkeinyorio ki keria narorire aaria ng’umbu?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abanto b’omochie bakamoiraneria: “Eyio nembeera y’omonto o Nyasae oria orwete ense y’Abayuda na akabana igoro y’amang’ana aya gwakorire ase ogosaria egesasiimero agwo Beteli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabateebia: “Tiga ere abeere aroro; onde tabaisa korusia amauga aye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio bagatiga amauga aye, amo nay’omobani oria onde orwete ase ense ya Samaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosia agatagora ne chinyomba chionsi chi’aase aimokererete igoro agosasimerwa, echiarenge ase emechie ya Samaria, chiria abarwoti b’Abaisraeli baagachete bakagechia Omonene goika akaba nendamwamu. Agachikora buna akorete agwo Beteli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agaitera abakuani bonsi b’aase aimokererete igoro, ase ebisasimero biarenge, na agasambera amauga ’abaanto igoro yabo. Erio akairana gochia Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosia okorenda Rituko Rinene ri’Epasaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Amg 3:1-9)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yosia omorwoti agachiika abanto bonsi, akabateebia, “Mobe ne Rituko Rinene ri’Epasaka ase Omonene, Nyasae oino, buna ariikire ase Egetabu eke y’Okobwatana kw’Ogotianania.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko ri’Epasaka buna eri konya tiriana koinyorwa korwa ase amatuko ’abagaambi, baria bagamberete Abaisraeli, gose ase amatuko onsi ay’abarwoti b’Abaisraeli, gose ay’abarwoti b’Abayuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ase omwaka o ikomi na gatano na gatato bw’okogaamba kwa Yosia, Rituko erio Rinene ri’Epasaka rikainyorwa na korendwa ase Omonene, agwo Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okoonchoreria konde kogokorwa na Yosia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo Yosia akarusia abanto bonsi baarenge koboria ogosemigwa korwa ase emeika y’abanto bakwete, na abarogi, na ebinyasae, na emegwekano ende y’ogosasimwa, na okogechia gwonsi kwarorekanete ase ense y’Abayuda na ase Yerusalemu. Nigo akorete ayio, erinde akore amang’ana onsi ay’amachiiko aria ariikire ase egetabu eria Hilikia Omokuani anyorete agwo ase enyomba y’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Morwoti onde tabeete agwo ritang’ani orenge buna Yosia, oria omobwatetie Omonene nenkoro yaye yonsi, na omoyo oye bwonsi, ne chinguru chiaye chionsi, koreng’ana n’amachiiko onsi a Musa; gose morwoti onde tanyorekanete buna ere ase abwo bamobwatetie korwa magega.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende nonya naboigo, Omonene taonchogete atige obotindi obonene bw’endamwamu yaye yogete igoro ase Abayuda ase engencho y’okogechia gwonsi Manase konya akorire amogechirie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Omonene akabora, “Nindusie Abayuda korwa ase obosio bwane, buna narusetie Abaisraeli; nintugute Yerusalemu, omochie oyio nachorete, na enyomba eria nateebete ng’a nimbeeke erieta riane aroro.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omoerio bw’okogaamba kwa Yosia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Amg 35:20—36:1)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono amang’ana ande onsi igoro ya Yosia, na aya onsi akorete, nigo ariikire ase Egetabu ki’ogokora kw’Abarwoti b’Abayuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase amatuko y’okogaamba kwa Yosia, Farao Neko, omorwoti o Misiri, akagenda korwana nomorwoti bw’Abaasuri agwo ase orooche rw’Eufarati. Yosia omorwoti akagenda agwo korwana nere, na ekero Farao Neko amorooche, akamoitera agwo Megido.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasomba baye bakamorusia Megido, bakabogoria omobere oye okwete ore ase egari ime, bakayoira Yerusalemu. Erio bakamotindeka ase embeera yaye omonyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abanto b’ense eria bakarenta Yehoahasi, omwana omomura o Yosia, bakamoaka amaguta, akaba omorwoti ase ribaga ria ise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoahasi omorwoti bw’Abayuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Amg 36:2)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoahasi nigo arenge nemiaka emerongo etato, ekero achagete kogamba, na akagaamba emetienyi etato agwo Yerusalemu. Ng’ina nigo arenge korokwa Hamutali, mosubati o Yeremia korwa Libuna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoahasi agakora ayare amabe ase obosio bw’Omonene, koreng’ana buna aya onsi chisokoro chiaye chiakorete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Farao Neko akamobwata, akamosiba agwo Ribula ase ense ya Hamati, erinde tabaisa kogamba agwo Yerusalemu, naende akabeekera abanto b’ense eria ebango ye chitalanta rigana erimo chi’echifeta na etalanta eyemo y’etaabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Farao Neko akabeeka Eliakimu, omwana omomura o Yosia, akamobeka akaba omorwoti ase ribaga ria ise, na akaonchora erieta riaye, akamoroka Yehoyakimu. Akarusia Yehoahasi agwo, akamoira Misiri, nere agakwera aroro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakimu omorwoti bw’Abayuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Amg 36:5)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakimu akaa Farao chifeta ne chitaabu chiria, korende eyio nigo yamobetereretie kobekera ense eria ebango ase ogochinyora na goakana Farao echi achiigete. Akarusia ebango ye chifeta ne chitaabu korwa ase abanto b’ense eria; kera omonto akarua ekerengo abeekeretwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakimu nigo arenge nemiaka emerongo ebere, na etano, ekero achagete kogamba; akagaamba emiaka ikomi nomo agwo Yerusalemu. Ng’ina nigo arenge korokwa Sebida, mosubati o Pedaya korwa Rumi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakimu agakora ayare amabe ase obosio bw’Omonene, buna koreng’ana chisokoro chiaye chiakorete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
